<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish first division summary on Monday: Barcelona 6 (Gheorghe Popescu 11, Ronaldo 31, Luis Enrique Martinez 36, Jose Maria Bakero 57, Luis Figo 76, Roger Garcia 81). Valladolid (Alen Peternac 59). Halftime 3-0. Attendance 72,000.</p>
